    "information": {
      "description": "<p><em>What Militech fields in a real war isn't what it sells in the showroom. The War Commando is an obscenely expensive package on the Commando chassis, with more guns and faster reactions. Squads of them stomped through the 4th Corporate War, and few have fought since. If you meet one, it belongs to a rich collector, or you've made some very bad choices.</em></p><p><strong>Cost:</strong> 37,774eb (Super Luxury)<br><strong>Frame / Shell:</strong> Beta / Hybrid Metalgear®<br><strong>Stats:</strong> 30 HP • 17 SP • BODY 14<br><strong>Onboard weapons:</strong> EQ Sniper Rifle w/ Smartgun Link, Drum Magazine, Sniper Rifle Rechamber &amp; Scout Barrel, Militech M-212E Syracuse w/ Long Tube, Militech Mk. 29 LMG w/ Smartgun Link &amp; Grenade Launcher Underbarrel, Militech M-265 Amalthea<br><strong>Onboard cyberware:</strong> Sandevistan, Low Light/Infrared/UV, Radio Communicator, Targeting Scope, Radar Detector, Scrambler/Descrambler</p><p>One pilot. The suit's stats modify the pilot's; see the Item Compendium, Power Armor.</p><p><small>Item Compendium (2070) • Power Armor</small></p>",
